# Frontend

- React + TypeScript + Vite. Fetch API via `frontend/src/lib/api.ts` only.
- Show evidence trail for every GCI score (guidance quote → actual → delta).
- No Buy/Hold recommendation UI in MVP. Display GCI 0–100, trend, metric breakdown.
- Prefer accessible labels; keep charts simple and labeled with units.
- Colocate page components under `pages/`; reusable widgets under `components/`.
- UX detail rule: `frontend-ux.mdc`. KB: `docs/kb/06-frontend-ux.md`.
